    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's easy to say those things but it doesn't change the math. the math says i'm a net loss. i spent my best years chasing something that didn't even exist, and now i'm just an old guy with nothing left to show for it. it feels like i'm just stuck in a loop of failing over and over. like the only thing left to do is just stop trying to fix it.",
